Z||000007||fogglethorpe||10-26-2001||08:41 PM||||ROF, I understand your frustration. I have always found it very disturbing that a few dimwits on the fringes of society can force their misguided worldview on the rest of us, because they whine and abuse the system.<BR>The Constitution, which enumerates and upholds our rights, is twisted and misinterpreted in such a way as to violate them instead. It's very upsetting.<P>I say, if anyone in the United States doesn't like it here, or appreciate the most free society in the history of the world, they should exercise one more freedom: <BR>The freedom to get the hell out and go live in an oppressive society somewhere else.||||reg||1
