Z||000009||Indiana_resto_guy||10-27-2001||08:33 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Return of Fiero:<BR>[B]This doesn't mention the teen who was suspended for 10 days for refusing<BR>to remove a flag from his<BR>locker.  He lost a relative in the attack and was honoring that memory.<P>I deleted the rest of this posting because of space. I AGREE totally with ALL of it.+<P>PROUD TO BE AN AMERICAN!<P>I'm of the opinion if the colors of RED, WHITE AND BLUE are offensive, DON'T LOOK AT THEM!<P>If your from a foreign country and it offends you, GO HOME, your not needed here and are NOT a citizen! (renew your VISA)<BR>Your opinion is theirs, not ours!<P>Religion? It's a free country. It's in the history of this country that people have the right to choose. <P>We also have the freedom of speech and the right to display!<P>22+ years of service to this country so some ding-a-ling from another country here to visit or go to school can tell me that I can't show my Patriotism? I think NOT!<P>I won't go on.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Earl||10-27-2001||10:52 AM|||| I am not upset. I AM MAD AS HELL. if you want to come hear and enjoy the prosperity and freedom this great nation offers fine you are welcome.But don't try to turn this country into the one you left, if it was that great why did you leave? <BR>    I don't like it when I get into an elevator and have to listen to people speaking another language, But they have the rite to say anything they want, and in any language. I support their rite to do so .<BR>   I just hate it when I have to chose a language when I go to the ATM .Everyone is pressured to make special accommodations for people who are either incapable or just to lazy to learn the language .<BR>   It dosn't offend me to see other peoples religious, cultural, or national symbols why do I have to hide mine in our country immigrant and native born alike. We are supposed to be equal, and it seems that we aren't the eisaly offended have more rites than we do they can parade their culturial and religious fervor in front of everyone and it is applauded as culturial pride and if we do the same, we are labled offensive  rightwing extremist .<BR>  And I for one am sick to death of it...||||reg||1
